<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Doctor Application Approved</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7fa;">
  <div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%); padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">Application Approved!</h1>
      <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #d1fae5; font-size: 14px;">Welcome to MediConnect</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding: 36px 32px;">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #1e293b; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;">Congratulations Dr. <%= name %>,</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
        We are thrilled to inform you that your application to practice as a certified doctor on the <strong>MediConnect</strong> platform has been verified and approved by our medical administration team.
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
        You can now log in to your account, complete your schedule availability, and start taking patient appointments.
      </p>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;">
        <a href="#" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; background-color: #10b981; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;">
          Go to Doctor Portal
        </a>
      </div>
      <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 28px 0;" />
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> MediConnect Healthcare System. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
